## Language

- Code, identifiers, comments, tests, logs, commit messages, branch names, PR titles, the changelog,
  file names and required wiki headings: English, always. <!-- kept: word -->
- Instructions for AI (this file, skills, tool descriptions): English. <!-- kept: word -->
- Conversation: {{conversation_language}} <!-- kept: word -->
- Documents: {{docs_language}} (tour, wiki content, specs, PR descriptions). <!-- kept: word -->
- Business terms: English code name, with the display name in the glossary (`ontology/glossary/<Term>.md`, drawn into `ontology/glossary.md`). <!-- kept: word -->
- Text that end users see follows the product's own language, not this rule. <!-- kept: word -->
